    "%@ needs to pee now! (%@ overdue)": {
      "comment": "A localized string that announces that a pet needs to go outside now, with an additional detail about how overdue the situation is. The first argument is the pet's name. The second argument is a string that describes the duration of the overdue period (e.g. \"15+ min\").",
